    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist The World Is Drowning</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br><strong><u>The World Is Drowning</u></strong> is a horror roguelike game that focuses on <strong>hydrophobia</strong> instead of traditional scares<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Climb a castle to the moon, always being on the run from the impending arrival of the sea of blood coming from below<br></li><li>Someone, or something, is trying to prevent you from reaching the moon. You'll have to overcome obstacles such as locked doors, puzzles, and patrolling enemies. Combat, is <strong>NOT</strong> always an option you should take<br></li><li>Every area in the castle contains a portal to the past. Do you take it, returning to your temporarily safe haven with stolen treasures, or do you keep climbing to the moon?<br></li><li>Build a smithery using valued goods from the castle to upgrade your weapons and unlock new abilities<br></li><li>If you die in real life, you die in the game</li></ul><br><u>While you wait, how about you try out my other game?</u><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><strong><u>The World Is Drowning</u></strong> is a horror roguelike game that focuses on <strong>hydrophobia</strong> instead of traditional scares<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Climb a castle to the moon, always being on the run from the impending arrival of the sea of blood coming from below<br></li><li>Someone, or something, is trying to prevent you from reaching the moon. You'll have to overcome obstacles such as locked doors, puzzles, and patrolling enemies. Combat, is <strong>NOT</strong> always an option you should take<br></li><li>Every area in the castle contains a portal to the past. Do you take it, returning to your temporarily safe haven with stolen treasures, or do you keep climbing to the moon?<br></li><li>Build a smithery using valued goods from the castle to upgrade your weapons and unlock new abilities<br></li><li>If you die in real life, you die in the game</li></ul><br><u>While you wait, how about you try out my other game?</u><br>",
    "short_description": "The world is drowning, and everyone you know is gone. If you wish to survive, you'll have to climb to the moon. On your way up you\u2019ll encounter many traps and monsters, but remember, you must never stop. The sea of blood is coming, and it will rob you of your final breath",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
